---
layout: layouts/base.njk
tone: green
title: "About Us"
description: "Palm River Academy is a licensed English language center in Hội An, open since 2017. Our vision, our staff and our story."
---
{% import "macros/icons.njk" as ic %}

{% set heroPhoto = "community-at-campus-wall" %}
{% set heroEyebrow = "About Us" %}
{% set heroTitle = 'Our vision. Our staff. <span class="mark">Our story.</span>' %}
{% set heroText = "A licensed English language center in Hội An since " + site.founded + ". Small classes, 20 months to 18 years." %}
{% include "partials/pagehero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Our story</p>
      <h2>Hội An's oldest international learning center</h2>
      <p>We opened in {{ site.founded }} for families who wanted their children to learn English without sitting still all day. We teach the Cambridge curriculum because schools everywhere recognise it, and we wrap it in things you can touch: cooking, art, technology, sport.</p>
      <p>Vietnamese and international families sit side by side. Classes stay at {{ site.classCap }} or fewer. Some students go on to universities abroad; others to work here at home.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="blob-wrap has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--tr">Since {{ site.founded }}</span>
      {% photo "student-lantern-making-hoi-an", "photo--lg photo--tall photo--tilt-r" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</p>
      <h2>Use English for something real</h2>
      <p class="lede">The fastest way to learn a language is to need it. So science, maths, cooking, art and sport all happen in English.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="method">
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("sparkle", "sun") }}<strong>Play first, projects later</strong><p>Play in Early Years. Experiments, building and presenting after that.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("chat", "blue") }}<strong>English is the tool</strong><p>It is how you measure, explain and argue. Children pick it up because they need it.</p></div>
      <div class="method__item">{{ ic.icon("star", "coral") }}<strong>Doing it yourself</strong><p>Students plan, make and present their own work, and get braver each time.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--coral">Our PRA values</p>
      <h2>Six principles</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="values values--3">
      <li><div><strong>Intellectual Exploration</strong><p>Asking questions, then finding the answers by hand.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Creative Expression</strong><p>Art, projects and ideas that are their own.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Sports and Fun</strong><p>Moving, playing, and enjoying it.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Community Impact</strong><p>Taking part in Hội An and giving back.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Global Citizenship</strong><p>Respect for other cultures, starting at the next desk.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Leadership Development</strong><p>Taking the lead and helping others follow.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Our academy team</p>
      <h2>Vietnamese and international teachers</h2>
      <p class="lede">{{ team.intro }}</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="team mt">
      {% for m in team.members %}
      <li>
        {% if photos["team-" + m.slug] %}{% photo "team-" + m.slug, "", "116px" %}{% else %}<div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ m.name | replace("Mr. ", "") | replace("Ms. ", "") | first }}</div>{% endif %}
        <strong>{{ m.name }}</strong>
        <em>{{ m.role }}</em>
        {% if m.teaches %}<small>{{ m.teaches }}</small>{% endif %}
        {% if m.bio %}<p>{{ m.bio }}</p>{% endif %}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div class="blob-wrap blob-wrap--green">
      {% photo site.campus.photo, "photo--lg photo--wide" %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Our campus</p>
      <h2>One site in Cẩm Thanh</h2>
      <p>Every age learns here, a few minutes from Hội An's old town. Classrooms, a library, a kitchen, a maker space, a turf field, a sand pit and a treehouse.</p>
      <p><strong>{{ site.campus.address }}</strong></p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.campus.mapUrl }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Open in Google Maps</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "blue" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
